      "summaries": {
        "en": "This curated guide serves as a comprehensive resource for anyone diving into generative AI, from research updates to interview prep. It organizes key papers, tutorials, and notebooks across LLMs, vision-language models, and more, making it easy to track the field's rapid evolution. The repository's strength lies in its structured, up-to-date collection, ideal for self-learners or educators building course materials. Use it to quickly find state-of-the-art references, practice with Jupyter notebooks, or prepare for technical interviews.",
        "zh": "这是一个为生成式AI学习者打造的全方位资源指南，涵盖从最新研究动态到面试准备的核心内容。项目将大语言模型、视觉语言模型等领域的经典论文、教程和Jupyter笔记本系统化整理，帮助用户快速追踪技术演进。其最大亮点在于结构清晰且持续更新，无论是自学还是教学都能直接使用。你可以通过它快速检索前沿文献，用配套笔记本动手实践，或作为面试复习的权威参考。",
        "es": "This curated guide serves as a comprehensive resource for anyone diving into generative AI, from research updates to interview prep. It organizes key papers, tutorials, and notebooks across LLMs, vision-language models, and more, making it easy to track the field's rapid evolution. The repository's strength lies in its structured, up-to-date collection, ideal for self-learners or educators building course materials. Use it to quickly find state-of-the-art references, practice with Jupyter notebooks, or prepare for technical interviews.",
