      "summaries": {
        "en": "Agent-Native is a TypeScript framework for building applications where AI agents are first-class citizens, solving the challenge of integrating LLMs into React apps with structured, controllable interactions. Its key insight is treating agent behavior as a composable, declarative layer—similar to React components—enabling developers to define tools, memory, and reasoning flows without boilerplate. You can use it to quickly prototype AI-powered features like chatbots, autonomous workflows, or copilots, and extend it with custom React components for UI-driven agent control.",
        "zh": "Agent-Native 是一个基于 TypeScript 的框架，旨在将 AI 智能体作为应用的一等公民，解决在 React 应用中集成大语言模型时面临的交互结构化与可控性难题。其核心设计理念是将智能体行为抽象为可组合的声明式层，类似 React 组件，开发者可以像搭建 UI 一样定义工具、记忆和推理流程，无需处理底层编排细节。你可以用它快速构建聊天机器人、自主工作流或 AI 副驾驶等原型，并通过自定义 React 组件实现 UI 驱动的智能体控制，让前端开发者也能轻松驾驭 AI 逻辑。",
        "es": "Agent-Native is a TypeScript framework for building applications where AI agents are first-class citizens, solving the challenge of integrating LLMs into React apps with structured, controllable interactions. Its key insight is treating agent behavior as a composable, declarative layer—similar to React components—enabling developers to define tools, memory, and reasoning flows without boilerplate. You can use it to quickly prototype AI-powered features like chatbots, autonomous workflows, or copilots, and extend it with custom React components for UI-driven agent control.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "agent-native stands out for agents, ai, and react in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Agent-Native is a TypeScript framework for building applications where AI agents are first-class citizens, solving the challenge of integrating LLMs into React apps with structured, controllable interactions. Its key insight is treating agent behavior as a composable, declarative layer—similar to React components—enabling developers to define tools, memory, and reasoning flows without boilerplate. You can use it to quickly prototype AI-powered features like chatbots, autonomous workflows, or copilots, and extend it with custom React components for UI-driven agent control.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/BuilderIO/agent-native for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
